# Tauri payload staging (regenerated by scripts/build.py).
# Symlinks to installer/bundled-skills/ etc. should NEVER be committed —
# everything is ignored by default, with explicit re-inclusions below for
# sub-trees whose contents ARE the source of truth (and aren't regenerated
# at build time). The `*` form (not the trailing-slash form) is required so
# the re-inclusion patterns below can take effect — a `payload/` rule would
# recursively shadow everything.
installer/payload/*
# Piper voice onnx+json models are checked in so the local TTS path works
# on first launch without a HuggingFace round-trip.
!installer/payload/voices/
!installer/payload/voices/**
# Pre-rendered onboarding TTS clips — committed alongside manifest.json
# so the desktop's onboarding flow plays offline without any cloud round-trip.
!installer/payload/onboarding-audio/
!installer/payload/onboarding-audio/**

# Backend runtime data (generated media/logs from tests + runs, never tracked)
data/
